  "_comment": "The 8-document corpus (Architecture §12: six documents, plus two supplementary PDFs added later: a food macronutrient table and the GWI Nutrition for Healthspan booklet). `id` prefixes every chunk_id. `extractor` picks the extraction backend: pymupdf for prose, docling where tables carry the content (EFSA), fda_chart for the FDA chart (docling mis-decodes its font; see ingestion/fda_chart.py), macros_table for the food-macros table (the generic extractor drops cells; see ingestion/macros_table.py). retrieval_date is recorded at download time in data/manifest.json, not here. `download_url` (optional) overrides where the file is fetched from when source_url blocks automated clients; source_url is always the citation URL. `exclude_pages` (optional, 1-based) lists pages left out of the index, e.g. tables of contents whose entries would otherwise outrank real content.",
